          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP226 Devon 

Out getting a few more BCPs south of Edmonton. 

Continued or journey to Devon next. Pulled into the nicely place turn out and had a short really to the cap. Nice to have posts on either side to mark its location. 

Thanks outforthehunt for all the BCPs and the fun I've had over the last couple weeks getting most of the ones in the Edmonton area. &lt;/p&gt;

